_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.beta7\n\n### System information\n\nN/A\n\n### Issue description\n\nResources deep duplication no longer validates null resource values before setting the properties.\n\n* Regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100673\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\nextends Control\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar image_texture = ImageTexture.new()\n\tvar _new_texture = image_texture.duplicate(true)\n```\n\nNow it calls `ImageTexture::set_image` with an invalid Variant value from `Resource::_duplicate_recursive` results in `INTERNAL ERROR: Invalid image`\n\nPrevious behavior was only calling the setter if the Object Variant is a valid resource.\n\n```c++\n\tcase Variant::Type::OBJECT: {\n\t\tif (!(E.usage & PROPERTY_USAGE_NEVER_DUPLICATE) && (p_subresources || (E.usage & PROPERTY_USAGE_ALWAYS_DUPLICATE))) {\n\t\t\tRef<Resource> sr = p;\n\t\t\tif (sr.is_valid()) {\n\t\t\t\tr->set(E.name, sr->duplicate(p_subresources));\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t} else {\n\t\t\tr->set(E.name, p);\n\t\t}\n\t} break;\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110208/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}